This directory contains vendored LDMud LPC header files copied for the
RealmsMUD mudlib.

RealmsMUD's upstream README says that an LDMud install should copy the contents
of the LDMud driver's mudlib/sys directory into this mudlib's /sys directory.
These files are included here for that mudlib-local requirement. They are not
JVMud engine code, and they should not be edited by hand.

Source:
- Repository: https://github.com/ldmud/ldmud
- Source path: mudlib/sys
- Commit: e1cbe804944c1f5865ad1beeeff220b43c48c7e3
- Retrieved: 2026-06-18

Update policy:
- Replace this directory from a recorded LDMud source revision.
- Keep JVMud-specific behavior in mudlibs/realmsmud/jvmud/ or JVMud runtime
  code, not in these vendored headers.
